# クロノ・クロス (Chrono Cross, PlayStation, SLPS-02364): the characters of its script by code, as the script
# lies in memory (a byte, or two for codes from 0xF8). The kana follow one plan, read off the opening's script
# beside its pictures: hiragana in the order of the fifty sounds from 0x76, voiced from 0xA4, half-voiced from
# 0xB8, small from 0xBD; katakana the same from 0xF81A (voiced 0xF848, half-voiced 0xF85C, small 0xF861). 0x75
# is a space. The signs and kanji were read in play, a page's codes beside its picture.
